    "author": "mi850323e",
    "text": "Translated from Chinese·Mayor Lu, just do your own job well. This kind of food broadcast really doesn't help society. The current situation of Taiwan's white dolphins is very dangerous ⚠️. Are you really going to help? You say it's led by the central government, but you can't stop it at all? If you can't do it, then publicly condemn it! The Taichung Port issue has huge benefits, and both the central government and the Taichung City Government are currently mistreating Taiwan's endangered white dolphins 🐬. The Taichung mayoral candidate, He Xinjun, even said that the local people have found a solution (to solve the problem of construction waste), but it ended up in the sea near Taichung Port. However, in recent years, Taichung Port has continued to fill the sea to create land, reducing the habitat of the white dolphins. Do you not know that the endangered white dolphins in Taiwan are in danger? Hong Kong originally had nearly 158-188 Chinese white dolphins, which are also our relatives. In 1997, due to continuous land filling and road development, the number of Chinese white dolphins decreased significantly, and in recent years, there are only about 38 left. It is now very dangerous and nearly extinct. This bloody case in Hong Kong has already demonstrated that Taiwan is going to repeat the same mistake and massively destroy the ocean ecosystem. Is it certain that Taiwan will do the same thing and drive them to extinction? If the habitat of white dolphins is destroyed and the water quality is polluted, and fish populations are scared away during construction, making it difficult for white dolphins to catch fish, they will almost die! Taiwan is now making the same mistake by driving them to extinction. However, there are less than 50 white dolphins left in Taiwan, and if they continue to destroy their home, they will be doomed to extinction. Please help by signing the petition ➡️https://forms.gle/EP53e3d9rTYg2j1U7docs.google.com【連署】搶救白海豚！台中港不應填海造陸擴建！",
